2 A straight man guards The Spirit (of The Law) with all his heart expressing it.
3 Added to this he does not leave behing him a trail of crookedness.
The purpose of this translation is to testify in I-Am-ness: Individualism the Equ[ilateral Concepts]/ Symbolism of AREALISM JUDAISM ROMANISM and to open the "S[eal]ed Orders," "The[ Veil] of The Temple", To The Light of the Simple Truth.
